One extremely essential communication skill for a job interview is spontaneous speaking, which means you need to answer a question immediately.
However, to collect your thought, structure your answer, and speak out load at the same time are highly hard, requiring people to put a lot of effort and practice day by day, week by week, or even month by month.

This article talks about speaking anxiety and how to handle it.

